; --- THE CAT: the support familiar (2026-10-31). It deals no damage: its pounce Weakens and slows what it
; lands on (Familiar.Mark), and between pounces it comes back to the wizard and the visit gives him its
; grants for 8 s - 8% cast speed and 4% evasion at level 1 (Familiar.CatCastSpeed, CatEvasion), which its
; levels add to (Effect 21 is Cast speed, 22 Evasion - SpellEffect; Player holds them through
; Familiar.LiveGrants). Its cooldown is its pounce rate; its range, how far from him it will pounce. One cat,
; always. Level 8: a pounce every 0.8 s, and 17% cast speed and 10% evasion for the wizard.

